2026-07-29T08:37:42.2661502Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-29T08:37:42.2662005Z i /tmp/RtmpnEhPqb/duckdb
2026-07-29T08:37:42.2662327Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-29T08:37:42.2662731Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-29T08:37:42.2663053Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-29T08:37:42.2663567Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-29T08:37:42.2664307Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-29T08:37:42.2665359Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-29T08:37:42.2914350Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-29T08:37:42.3029244Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-29T08:37:42.3471893Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-29T08:37:42.3633375Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
